#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:1
#: 8e0b7c7ceac447119cda9c34c856c993
msgid "能量基线平移：去掉巨大的常数能量"
msgstr "Energy Baseline Shift: Remove a Large Constant Energy"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:3
#: 8efb23b797914bb69777c0683fda464d
msgid ""
"能量基线平移最常见的用途，是在训练前去掉 DFT 总能量中的巨大常数项。某些 ABACUS、CP2K 数据按原子归一后仍可能达到数千甚至数万 "
"eV，而模型真正需要学习的是小得多的结构间能量差。直接用 `float32` "
"训练时，大数会占用有效位数；先把基线移到零附近，可以给这些小能量差留下更多数值精度。"
msgstr ""
"The most common purpose of energy baseline shifting is to remove a large "
"constant term from DFT total energies before training. Some ABACUS and CP2K "
"datasets can still reach thousands or even tens of thousands of eV per atom, "
"while the model needs to learn much smaller energy differences between "
"structures. With `float32` training, the large values consume significant "
"digits; shifting the baseline close to zero preserves more numerical "
"precision for those small differences."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:5
#: aaac6fc57d774fbb87d4115630535ebd
msgid ""
"在 `energy` 图上，这类问题通常表现为 DFT 能量和 NEP "
"预测**整体错开**，但点云的相对形状仍然一致。平移只处理能量零点，不会让模型本身变准；如果散点很散、弯曲，或者只有少数结构偏离，应先检查模型和数据。"
msgstr ""
"In the `energy` plot, this usually appears as a **systematic offset** between "
"DFT energies and NEP predictions while the relative shape of the point cloud "
"remains the same. Shifting only changes the energy zero; it does not improve "
"the model. If the points are scattered, curved, or only a few structures are "
"off, inspect the model and data first."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:7
#: 603f2e7e87fe4dddb2647848e4ea3fb6
msgid "1. 先看能量图"
msgstr "1. Inspect the energy plot first"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:9
#: b40ca1471b564357b80465bf4842ae7b
msgid "在 `NEP Dataset Display` 中打开带 DFT 能量的数据和对应的 NEP 模型，然后看 `energy` 散点图。"
msgstr "Open the dataset containing DFT energies and its corresponding NEP model in `NEP Dataset Display`, then inspect the `energy` scatter plot."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:11
#: c7a811ffd2a34844910834d42ed0cee9
msgid "能量图和能量基线平移按钮"
msgstr "Energy plot and energy baseline shift button"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:11
#: c7a811ffd2a34844910834d42ed0cee9
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_entry.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_entry.png"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:16
#: a29370750ef14721a862aaadee0f6074
msgid "确认是巨大的整体基线后，点击工具栏中的 `Energy baseline shift`。"
msgstr "After confirming a large overall baseline, click `Energy baseline shift` in the toolbar."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:18
#: 9f1796ec41a84e50b8ed295418f685b2
msgid ""
"平移会修改当前数据集里的 `energy`。程序会把第一次平移前的值记在 "
"`energy_original`，但不会自动撤销后续平移。操作前仍建议先导出一份原始数据。"
msgstr ""
"The shift changes `energy` in the current dataset. NepTrainKit records the "
"value before the first shift as `energy_original`, but it does not "
"automatically undo later shifts. Export a copy of the original data first."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:20
#: 8701e0a1882e444dbf19a078cbe6d9e6
msgid "2. 按这个例子设置"
msgstr "2. Use these settings"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:22
#: 0cf83dbc09e44796b61bef5f2106dbe2
msgid "能量基线平移设置窗口"
msgstr "Energy baseline shift settings"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:22
#: 0cf83dbc09e44796b61bef5f2106dbe2
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_shift_dialog.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/show_nep_reference/g_shift_dialog.png"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:27
#: 75c44c0a01d94de7ae7b567286f35734
msgid "第一次使用时这样设置即可："
msgstr "For the first run, use the following settings:"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:29
#: c9319a625dfb453cae36423a6bf0b648
msgid "`Use existing preset` 保持空白。"
msgstr "Leave `Use existing preset` empty."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:30
#: 241b8634373e4440aed4ef8783a200bb
msgid "如果数据来自同一软件、同一套计算设置，把分组规则填写为 `.*`，让所有 `Config_type` 共用一套基线。"
msgstr "If the data come from the same software and computational settings, enter `.*` so all `Config_type` values share one baseline."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:31
#: dc514aa57a6a4bf380b51870caac0c6b
msgid "`Alignment mode` 选择 `DFT to NEP`。它根据当前 NEP 预测，拟合每种元素的能量基线，并平移数据集中的 DFT 能量。"
msgstr "Set `Alignment mode` to `DFT to NEP`. It uses the current NEP predictions to fit a baseline for each element and shifts the dataset's DFT energies."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:32
#: 389e47c5e33646a5b5234546a6cfa763
msgid "`Max generations`、`Population size` 和 `Convergence tolerance` 先保留默认值。"
msgstr "Keep the default values for `Max generations`, `Population size`, and `Convergence tolerance`."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:33
#: 6223a91dd1f2460b8342cdc47eff256c
msgid "点击 `OK`，等待能量图重新绘制。"
msgstr "Click `OK` and wait for the energy plot to redraw."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:35
#: 26fd375264f045b48444c9313feb8343
msgid ""
"不要仅因为数据里有多个 `Config_type` "
"就逐组拟合。即使来自同一软件，每组单独拟合也可能把求解过程中的微小偏差吸收到基线里；同一计算来源使用 `.*` 更稳妥。"
msgstr ""
"Do not fit each group separately just because the dataset contains multiple "
"`Config_type` values. Even for the same software, separate fits can absorb "
"small solver differences into the baselines; using `.*` for one calculation "
"source is more robust."

msgid ""
"`Config_type` 分组主要用于区分不同能量基线来源。只有数据混合了不同软件时才拆组，例如 "
"`abacus.*;cp2k.*`，多条规则用英文分号 `;` "
"分隔。不同泛函、赝势或计算精度带来的差异不只影响能量零点，不要靠平移强行混合。"
msgstr ""
"`Config_type` grouping is mainly for distinguishing different energy-"
"baseline sources. Split groups only when the dataset mixes different "
"software, for example `abacus.*;cp2k.*`; separate rules with semicolons. "
"Differences in functionals, pseudopotentials, or numerical settings affect "
"more than the energy zero, so do not force such data together with a shift."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:37
#: 2fcd931411f741fc8e54cb5ac4622290
msgid "3. 看结果是否正确"
msgstr "3. Check the result"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:39
#: 2fb2abb9164d487bbe0bf0ecde00ce16
msgid "平移后回到 `energy` 图："
msgstr "Return to the `energy` plot after the shift:"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:41
#: 9f8c591d34c74c5dbad49bcd6a88f79c
msgid "消除整体能量偏移后的散点图"
msgstr "Scatter plot after removing the systematic energy offset"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:41
#: 9f8c591d34c74c5dbad49bcd6a88f79c
msgid ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_result.png"
msgstr ""
".. image:: "
"../_static/image/generated/tutorials/energy_baseline_shift_result.png"

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:46
#: 4a98ad3de8164560b638e8de1206e0b3
msgid "巨大的绝对能量基线被去掉，能量回到更适合训练的数值范围；"
msgstr "The large absolute-energy baseline is removed, bringing energies into a numerical range better suited to training."

msgid "点云整体靠近对角线，说明主要差异确实来自能量零点；"
msgstr "The point cloud moves close to the diagonal, indicating that the main difference came from the energy zero."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:47
#: 8d7d4bd163814b3bae25949d2c7e8283
msgid "点云的相对顺序和形状应该基本保留；"
msgstr "The relative ordering and shape of the point cloud should remain largely unchanged."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:48
#: 3f7aebea01cd413ca482de695750aabb
msgid "如果仍明显散开，不要继续反复平移，转去检查异常结构、分组规则和模型误差。"
msgstr "If the points remain widely scattered, do not repeat the shift. Check abnormal structures, grouping rules, and model error instead."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:50
#: 0f79ba489ebc45a6936319a7c4866a9e
msgid "能量基线不是给所有结构减去同一个常数。程序会根据结构中的元素个数，减去对应的逐元素基线。因此，包含不同元素或不同原子数的结构也可以放在同一数据集中处理。"
msgstr "An energy baseline is not one constant subtracted from every structure. NepTrainKit subtracts element-specific baselines according to the element counts, so structures with different elements or atom counts can be handled in one dataset."

#: ../../source/example/energy-baseline-shift.md:52
#: 93e70e4b37c441d2bcc6dea3707d2415
msgid ""
"确认结果后，用 `Save` 导出新文件，不要覆盖原始训练集。以后需要处理同一类数据时，可以勾选 `Save baseline as "
"preset` 保存本次基线；预设只适用于元素和 `Config_type` 分组方式相符的数据。"
msgstr ""
"After checking the result, use `Save` to export a new file without "
"overwriting the original training set. For the same kind of data in the "
"future, select `Save baseline as preset`; a preset applies only when the "
"elements and `Config_type` grouping match."
